{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0243_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b7c3235128d0760204d4ec8c2e56dead736c9e0cf3217bace26eddc18740cef3", "ja": "（今日は、地域のお祭りの仕事だ。\n杏奈は、屋台の手伝いをすることになっている）", "zh": "（今天的工作是参加当地的祭典。\n杏奈要帮忙照看摊位。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0243_1001_024ann", "source_sha256": "f718e55d0c2c07b1148141afa6ae4f3767a9098e704307ce3d57603dd16d419e", "ja": "{$P$}さん、\n杏奈……練習、バッチリです……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n杏奈……练习，已经完全没问题了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0243_1002_024ann", "source_sha256": "88100482574772e238b6587069964ceaf8d77d97f6ee193720865c8b669fbb08", "ja": "タコ焼き、上手に……ひっくり返せる\nように……なった、よ……♪", "zh": "章鱼烧……已经能熟练地翻面了……哦……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0243_1003_p", "source_sha256": "434aaf285f4054ad7d3bea6839c4f50e5064caf9a1ae4287e47335d70cb14f93", "ja": "おっ、そうか！\nそれなら安心だな。今日はよろしく頼んだぞ。", "zh": "哦，是吗！\n那我就放心了。今天就拜托你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0243_1004_024ann", "source_sha256": "00bce20d780c06019ef621e0bb16a2c36f9cf1a6e2fb6cb8a2aab59ad6aed204", "ja": "はい……あ……でも、杏奈……。\nいっこ……不安なことが、あって……。", "zh": "嗯……啊……但是，杏奈……有一件……让人不安的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0243_1005_024ann", "source_sha256": "f3bb813e9275cf6c5bb59c733e62bd52edc26d7dea18559ead8dbac65210733a", "ja": "タコ焼き屋のおじさんに……。\nもっと笑顔で、元気よくって、言われたけど……。", "zh": "章鱼烧店的大叔说……要笑得更开心一点，更有精神一点……可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0243_1006_024ann", "source_sha256": "097ea68170eddfc64311b287bec424bcd4d05abf5b5a57423faf787d16d62535", "ja": "集中、すると……。\nどうしても、無口になるから……困ってます……。", "zh": "一集中精神……就会不由得变得沉默，所以……很困扰……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0243_1007_p", "source_sha256": "1e71647ee35d909905faeba9fa1c1a4dac38362aa86d94be18aa202ce648cc60", "ja": "なるほど、真剣になりすぎてか……それなら、\n普段のライブと同じ心構えでやったらどうだろう？", "zh": "原来如此，是因为太过认真了吗……既然这样，\n要不要试着用和平时演出一样的心态来做呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0243_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "0b83db4a111df788d6fefc6a8e26df5cb5ead825439b00c14f77bc331047ea14", "ja": "ライブ……？　あ、確かに……\nいつも、真剣だけど……笑顔に、なれてます……。", "zh": "演出……？啊，确实……\n平时虽然也很认真……但还是能露出笑容……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0243_1009_p", "source_sha256": "9d6dda818c4533733003c7be58b9e6b5f016793f67171af62c5fffdad5e31472", "ja": "うん、それにたこ焼きのおじさんも、\n杏奈のファンらしいしな。", "zh": "嗯，而且卖章鱼烧的大叔好像也是杏奈的粉丝。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0243_1010_p", "source_sha256": "df31eb893ba3253120e0768320d0dd698579d20b8bfb279da1bf6705494a3203", "ja": "ファンを楽しませるには、\nまず杏奈自身が楽しまないとな。", "zh": "要让粉丝开心，首先杏奈自己也得开心才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0243_1011_024ann", "source_sha256": "f51cf9a21a41b6d7bc34cb9270dbea8027f16a8d83efe90c7aa94ba5b0c0480c", "ja": "おじさん、が……？\n練習中……ずっと怖い顔、してたけど……。", "zh": "大叔……？他在练习的时候……一直都板着一张可怕的脸……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0243_1012_p", "source_sha256": "8953195220021afad0ea7b71d646a191a3f3926e8c142bb357ded4640ffeef71", "ja": "諦めずに頑張ってる杏奈の姿にグッと来たらしい。\nすっかりファンになったって言ってたよ。", "zh": "他说，被不肯放弃、努力坚持的杏奈打动了。还说自己已经彻底成了粉丝。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0243_1013_024ann", "source_sha256": "4b470d847f2631f2ba1fa8fa48cce8cb9b72c563092b1d36d4e97d05505d2940", "ja": "そう、だったんだ……。\n一生懸命、頑張ってよかった……です……。", "zh": "原来，是这样啊……。\n努力过来，真是太好了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0243_1014_024ann", "source_sha256": "69bf08b71e78028c04e306a728c2148a0c059f2eb088a23d005c73312c4c86ca", "ja": "なら、今日は……楽しんでもらえる、ように……。\n杏奈も、楽しく……タコ焼き、焼くね……♪", "zh": "那么，今天……为了让你也能开心……杏奈也会开开心心地……烤章鱼烧……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0243_1015_p", "source_sha256": "d121347ff0c32ba21ac630be123eefb042a9620ca8417cb90725c0b55c74c35f", "ja": "ああ。せっかくのお祭りだしな。\n杏奈が作るたこ焼き、楽しみにしてるぞ。", "zh": "是啊，难得有这样的祭典嘛。\n我很期待杏奈做的章鱼烧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0243_1016_024ann", "source_sha256": "7dab35fa43fb21e34d2934a3d7427bab15492c2817c6521143f7c897c954a44f", "ja": "ん……♪　じゃあ、えっと……\n{$P$}さんには、お礼に……。", "zh": "嗯……♪　那、那个……\n给{$P$}先生的回礼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0243_1017_024ann", "source_sha256": "4d06fab41c92929c9f3f89c81885082450356bfb29dee3c10fed428fffd1817e", "ja": "焼き立てを、食べさせて、あげます……。\nアツアツ、だよ……♪", "zh": "我来让你吃刚出炉的……  \n还是热乎乎的哦……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
